message: "If you use BUCSS, please cite the package, so that the version you used is credited, together with the article that introduces the method (listed as the preferred citation). citation('BUCSS') in R lists the other methodological articles."
type: software
title: "BUCSS: Bias and Uncertainty Corrected Sample Size"
