version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-29"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/yelleKneK/BUCSS"
repository-artifact: "https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=BUCSS"
url: "https://yelleKneK.github.io/BUCSS/"
abstract: >-
  Implements sample size planning for a future study from the summary
  statistics of a prior study, correcting the prior effect for publication
  bias and uncertainty so that the planned study attains its target
  statistical power more reliably than methods that take a sample effect size
  at face value. Planners cover t tests, analysis of variance and covariance,
  regression, correlation, a two-group multivariate comparison, and the chi
  square difference between nested models.
keywords:
  - R package
  - sample size planning
  - statistical power
  - publication bias
  - effect size uncertainty
  - replication
